{
  "name": "hp-b5-rise",
  "why": "B5 with a gun that never echoes `$SPAWN`: an `$HP` with health is the gun confirming the life, so an unattributed zero after it is a death at once. In the next life a stale zero is held, and a rise from that zero is neither a gain moment nor damage (no low-health alert).",
